Layered\ architecture\ considering\ only\ dependencies\ in\ layers,\ consisting\ of\nlayer\ 'Gateway'\ ('..agent.gateway..')\nlayer\ 'Runtime'\ ('..agent.runtime..')\nlayer\ 'Tools'\ ('..agent.tools..')\nlayer\ 'Governance'\ ('..agent.governance..')\nlayer\ 'Executor'\ ('..agent.executor..')\nlayer\ 'Domain'\ ('..agent.domain..')\nlayer\ 'Infra'\ ('..agent.infra..')\nwhere\ layer\ 'Gateway'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Runtime',\ 'Tools',\ 'Governance',\ 'Domain',\ 'Infra']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Runtime'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Tools',\ 'Governance',\ 'Domain',\ 'Infra']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Tools'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Domain']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Governance'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Domain']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Executor'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Domain']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Domain'\ may\ not\ access\ any\ layer\nwhere\ layer\ 'Infra'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Domain'],\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A72.1\uFF1A\u4F9D\u8D56\u5FC5\u987B\u5355\u5411\uFF1Btools\ \u53EA\u80FD\u4F9D\u8D56\ domain\uFF08\u6267\u884C\u5668\u901A\u8FC7\ domain\ \u7AEF\u53E3\u63A5\u5165\uFF09=f65993eb-4bd2-4331-98cd-dcabd4c49121
no\ classes\ should\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['..util..',\ '..utils..',\ '..common..',\ '..helper..',\ '..helpers..'],\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A72.2\uFF1A\u7981\u6B62\ util/common/helper\uFF0C\u8BF7\u5F52\u5165\u6240\u5C5E\u9886\u57DF=19fc382c-b1ef-4e3c-b816-25c58b426d43
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..agent.domain..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['org.springframework..',\ 'org.apache.ibatis..',\ 'io.agentscope..',\ 'dev.langchain4j..',\ 'jakarta.persistence..',\ 'com.baomidou..'],\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A72.3\uFF1Adomain\ \u5FC5\u987B\u4E0E\u6846\u67B6\u65E0\u5173=8ca4d52a-2ed0-47c4-8fb9-d26e875ca1bd
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..agent.executor..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['io.agentscope..',\ 'dev.langchain4j..',\ 'org.springframework.ai..'],\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A71.1\ A3\uFF1A\u6267\u884C\u9762\u5FC5\u987B\u662F\u786E\u5B9A\u6027\u4EE3\u7801=7349bd7e-b399-4ff8-a275-fd3448a54924
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..agent.tools..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'java.lang.ProcessBuilder',\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A74\uFF1A\u547D\u4EE4\u6267\u884C\u53EA\u80FD\u51FA\u73B0\u5728\u6267\u884C\u9762=6fea9481-6e8e-48c3-8e49-bf2b4180e8e2
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['..agent.gateway..',\ '..agent.runtime..',\ '..agent.tools..',\ '..agent.governance..']\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.github.dockerjava..',\ 'io.fabric8..'],\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A71.1\ A1\uFF1ADocker/K8s\ \u5BA2\u6237\u7AEF\u53EA\u80FD\u51FA\u73B0\u5728\u6267\u884C\u9762=f0e15fd0-8b8f-4008-b331-db0e45e9e2c3
no\ fields\ should\ be\ annotated\ with\ @Autowired,\ because\ \u9879\u76EE\u89C4\u7EA6\ \u00A710.1\uFF1A\u5FC5\u987B\u4F7F\u7528\u6784\u9020\u5668\u6CE8\u5165=959b6514-b8d1-45bc-95cf-74878d1d4723
